\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar inches lower, interbank rates eyed.  \b0\par\par\uc2 511 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Dezember 2004\par 04:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, Dec 9 (Reuters) - The Hong Kong dollar eased\par slightly on Thursday morning after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary\par Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (HKMA) \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Wednesday to stem the local\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's strength, and amid some retracement for the greenback.\par     "There was some technical dollar-buying after the market saw\par the HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 7.77 overnight and partly due to the U.S.\par dollar's broad-based rebound," said a dealer from a European\par bank.\par     The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2         weakened to 7.7723 to the U.S.\par dollar in early trade before trading back to 7.7715/17 by 0242\par GMT, compared with 7.7702/04 in late Asian trade on Wednesday.\par     However, dealers said there was still strong underlying\par demand for the Hong Kong dollar given a spate of initial public\par offerings in the territory, which had mopped up liquidity.\par  \par     The overnight interbank rate shot up to 3.50-3.75 percent\par from Wednesday's 1.00-1.25 percent.\par     Hong Kong dollar forwards were mixed. Short-dated contracts\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 edged higher with the overnight and tomorrow/next forwards  \par \par \uc2 trading at a premium amid the tightness in interbank liquidity,  \par \par \uc2 dealers said. But forwards at the long end were trapped in narrow  \par \par \uc2 ranges.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The tomorrow/next forwards          were quoted at a premium\par of 8-9 pips, rising from 2 pips in late trade on Wednesday.\par     The discount on one-year forwards          was trading at\par 1,355/1,335 pips, little changed from Wednesday's close of\par 1,360/1340 pips.\par     "Pressure on interbank rates is expected to ease after the\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Housing Authority's link real estate investment trust  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 debuts next Thursday and the receiving banks clear the IPO  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 cheques," another trader said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The HKMA, the territory's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , sold a total  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of HK$1.189 billion of U.S. dollar in offshore trade on Wednesday  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 in two separate moves in a bid to curb the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 advance against the greenback.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "This week, market liquidity has tightened because of IPOs.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Some people have to sell U.S. dollars in the spot market for Hong  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Kong dollars to meet their own funding requirements," the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 European dealer said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 So far this week, the HKMA has sold a cumulative HK$1.671  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 billion. As a result, the aggregate balance - the sum of  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 balances on clearing accounts maintained by banks with the HKMA  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - will rise to HK$15.83 billion after settlement on Friday.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    Morning       Previous Close\par                    At 0238 GMT   At 0859 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT          7.7713/15     7.7703/05\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month       -370 / -360   -355 / -350\par  Six-month         -740 / -725   -735 / -720\par  One-year          -1355/-1335   -1360/-1340\par  INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight         3.50 / 3.75   1.00 / 1.25\par  Three-month       0.53 / 0.58   0.51 / 0.56\par  Six-month         0.73 / 0.78   0.66 / 0.71\par  One-year          1.00 / 1.15   1.08 / 1.13\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters contributor page .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041209e0c9003bj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
