\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar remains firm despite HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 550 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 2004\par 11:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Oct 28 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar remained\par stubbornly strong against the U.S. dollar in Thursday afternoon\par trade despite the latest \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary\par Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (HKMA) to weaken it.\par     The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2         was trading at 7.7765/66 per U.S.\par dollar at 0922 GMT after hitting 7.7725 -- the highest level\par since Feb. 20 -- in early afternoon, versus 7.7781/82 in late\par Asian trade on Wednesday.\par     "It looks likely there will be a further inflow of funds as\par the spot rate (U.S. dollar against the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ) is still\par under heavy selling pressure," said a dealer from a Japanese\par bank.\par  \par     He pointed out that there was a number of factors leading the\par local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  higher on Thursday.\par     "The market is still betting on a potential revaluation of\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , with the discount on one-year yuan NDFs moving   \f28 \par \par \uc2 to 2,800 points today. A rebound in the local stock market and   \par \par \uc2 general weakness for the U.S. dollar against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is   \par \par \uc2 also helping," said the dealer.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Hong Kong's blue-chip Hang Seng Index        ended up 2.14\par percent on Thursday.\par     The Japanese yen        hit a six-month high against the\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar on Thursday as falling oil prices boosted Tokyo stocks,   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 while the dollar remained close to eight-month lows against the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 euro on concerns about the U.S. trade gap.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The HKMA, the territory's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , sold HK$3.888   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 billion on Thursday afternoon in a bid to curb the local   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's strength, which is pegged to the U.S. dollar at   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 HK$7.80.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As a result, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will lift the aggregate balance   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - the sum of balances on clearing accounts maintained by banks   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 with the HKMA - to HK$12.607 billion after settlement on Monday.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Since Oct. 8, the HKMA has sold a cumulative HK$9.337 billion\par in the market.\par     "There has been speculative trade on the yuan but I don't\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 think China will make a change in its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy in the near   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 future as it is conducting some sort of banking reforms," another   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dealer from a local bank said.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Hong Kong dollar forwards fell across the board on Thursday\par following a firmer local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The discount on one-year forwards          was trading at\par 1,150/1,120 pips by late afternoon after hitting a low of 1,200\par pips and wider than Wednesday's close of 1,040/1,020 pips.\par                    C