o see if the Hong Kong dollar will\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par break through the 7.7750 mark against the greenback, a level last\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par hit on Monday when the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stepped in to\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stem the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rise.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the cash market, interbank rates remained soft with the\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par overnight rate quoted at 0.03-0.05 percent after a major lender\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par released liquidity in early trade, one dealer from a local bank\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    Morning       Previous Close\par                    At 0252 GMT   At 0924 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT          7.7751/53     7.7783/84\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month       -355 / -345   -337 / -332\par  Six-month         -655 / -645   -615 / -605\par  One-year          -1120/-1110   -1040/-1020\par  INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight         0.03 / 0.05   0.02 / 0.12\par  Three-month       0.40 / 0.43   0.43 / 0.48\par  Six-month         0.63 / 0.67   0.63 / 0.68\par  One-year          1.07 / 1.10   1.07 / 1.12\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Reuters contributor page .\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041028e0as002e5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
