\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar eases after recent HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 444 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Oktober 2004\par 11:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Oct 26 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar pared some\par of its recent gains on Tuesday after aggressive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Monday afternoon to stem the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's advance against the greenback.\par     "The market was choppy. There was a correction in the\par greenback against major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the afternoon. The local\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  edged lower as there was some buying interest (for U.S.\par dollar) from Singapore banks," one dealer said.\par     The dollar rose to $1.2790/93 per euro        by 0907 GMT.\par Against the yen, the dollar found support amid wariness over\par Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . It was traded at 106.77/80 yen .\par  \par     At 0908 GMT, the Hong Kong dollar        eased to 7.7808/10\par per U.S. dollar, versus Monday's high of 7.7750.\par     "I think the spot rate (U.S. dollar against the local\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ) will not rise too much as some investors remain bearish\par on holding dollars," the dealer said.\par     Recent high oil prices, mixed U.S.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  economic data and a\par widening U.S. current account deficit have weighed on the\par greenback.\par     Meanwhile, discounts on Hong Kong dollar forwards narrowed on\par Tuesday following a softer local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , dealers said.\par     The discount on one-year forwards          was trading at\par 1,010/990 pips versus Monday's low of 1,070 pips.\par     "The recent inflow of funds on persistent speculation of a\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 yuan revaluation, and perhaps also the upcoming IPOs in the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 territory, have resulted in abundant liquidity in the aggregate   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 balance, leading to wider interest rate differentials between   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong and the United States," one trader from a European bank   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The aggregate balance - the sum of balances on clearing   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 accounts maintained by banks with the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary   \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  - will rise to HK$8.635 billion after settlement on   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Wednesday of HK$3.113 million of capital inflows.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                    At 0856 GMT   At 0223 GMT   At 0936 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT          7.7809/10     7.7782/83     7.7804/06\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month       -323 / -310   -330 / -320   -330 / -320\par  Six-month         -605 / -595   -625 / -605   -610 / -590\par  One-year          -1010/ -990   -1050/-1020   -1060/-1010\par  INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight         0.15 / 0.20   0.25 / 0.30   0.15 / 0.25\par  Three-month       0.42 / 0.47   0.40 / 0.45   0.38 / 0.43\par  Six-month         0.59 / 0.64   0.57 / 0.62   0.61 / 0.66\par  One-year          1.05 / 1.10   1.00 / 1.05   1.03 / 1.08\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be 