currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's advance against the U.S. dollar,    \par \par \uc2  and dealers see that as a support level.    \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has traded slightly stronger than its peg    \par \par \uc2  of HK$7.80 per U.S. dollar over the past few weeks on speculation    \par \par \uc2  of a possible revaluation of the Chinese yuan .    \par \par \uc2  One dealer from a Japanese bank said players were not eager    \par \par \uc2  to engage in arbitrage trade at the moment even though local    \par \par \uc2  rates are lower than their U.S. counterparts.    \par \par \uc2  "Although buying U.S. dollars in arbitrage yields higher    \par \par \uc2  interest rates, there is a risk because the entire market trend    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    Morning       Previous Close\par                    At 0307 GMT   At 0912 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT          7.7855/56     7.7860/61\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month       -282 / -272   -263 / -258\par  Six-month         -515 / -505   -490 / -480\par  One-year          -930 / -910   -870 / -850\par  INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight         0.25 / 0.30   0.25 / 0.30\par  Three-month       0.65 / 0.70   0.73 / 0.75\par  Six-month         0.84 / 0.89   0.90 / 0.92\par  One-year          1.20 / 1.25   1.25 / 1.30\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Reuters contributor page .\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041025e0ap002xm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
