\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr eases after recent  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  by HKMA.   \b0\par\par\uc2 488 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2004\par 05:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Oct 21 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar trimmed\par some of its recent gains on Thursday morning after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (HKMA) \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  late on Wednesday to stem\par the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's advance against the greenback.\par  \par     But dealers said the general weakness of the U.S. dollar\par could boost Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  including the Hong Kong dollar.\par     "The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakened to 7.7973/78 in early trade\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 before some selling interest on the U.S. dollar re-emerged, in   \f28 \par \par \uc2 part because a softer dollar/yen," said a trader from a European   \par \par \uc2 bank.   \par \par \uc2 The greenback hit a fresh three-month low against the yen   \par \par \uc2 on Thursday as a rebound in oil prices aggravated worries   \par \par \uc2 about the outlook for the U.S. economy and its yawning current   \par \par \uc2 account deficit.   \par \par \uc2 At 0301 GMT the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at   \par \par \uc2 7.7863/64, pulling back from Wednesday's high of 7.7850, a level   \par \par \uc2 at which the territory's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped in to   \par \par \uc2 stabilise the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is pegged to the U.S. dollar   \par \par \uc2 at HK$7.80.   \par \par \uc2 The HKMA sold HK$779 million of U.S. dollar on Wednesday   \par \par \uc2 afternoon. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will lift the aggregate balance -   \par \par \uc2 the sum of balances on clearing accounts maintained by banks with   \par \par \uc2 the HKMA - to HK$5.61 billion after the settlement of the   \par \par \uc2 capital inflows on Monday.   \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong dollar has been trading slightly stronger than   \par \par \uc2 its pegged exchange rate in recent weeks on lingering speculation   \par \par \uc2 of a possible change in China's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is often seen as a proxy to the Chinese\par yuan as the two economies become more closely integrated.\par     Hong Kong dollar forwards fell further on Thursday, with the\par discount on one-year contracts  widened to 845/825 pips\par from Wednesday's close of 800/790 pips.\par     The Hong Kong government will release consumer price index\par (CPI) data for September late on Thursday.\par     A Reuters survey of eight economists forecast the composite\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 CPI rose 0.80 percent seasonally adjusted in the 12 months   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 through September for a third month of annual inflation, matching   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 an increase in the 12 months through August.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Hong Kong financial markets will be closed on Friday for the\par Chung Yeung Festival, or grave-sweeping, holiday.\par                    Morning       Previous Close\par                    At 0301 GMT   At 0857 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT          7.7863/64     7.7851/52\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month       -252 / -247   -238 / -233\par  Six-month         -475 / -465   -455 / -445\par  One-year          -845 / -825   -800 / -790\par  INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight         0.25 / 0.23   0.25 / 0.30\par  Three-month       0.82 / 0.87   0.83 / 0.88\par  Six-month         0.96 / 1.01   0.98 / 1.03\par  One-year          1.30 / 1.35   1.35 / 1.40\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041021e0al002bg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
