\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr weak, HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 , more outflows seen.   \b0\par\par\uc2 468 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 2004\par 06:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , July 16 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar weakened\par on Friday morning as funds flowed out of the territory, forcing\par the de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to step in three times in a bid to keep\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  steady against the U.S. dollar.\par     By 0238 GMT the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (HKMA) reported\par it bought a total of HK$3.90 billion worth of Hong Kong dollars\par from banks.\par  \par     By 0345 GMT the Hong Kong dollar        was trading at\par 7.7999/7.80 per U.S. dollar versus HK$7.7998/99 late on Thursday.\par     Under Hong Kong's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  board system, the HKMA is\par committed to buying Hong Kong dollars in exchange for U.S.\par dollars at a fixed rate of HK$7.8 to the U.S. dollar.\par     The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has suffered selling pressure recently as\par players engage in arbitrage trades due to the interest rate\par differential between Hong Kong and U.S. rates.\par    "There was some buying for the U.S.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollar against the local\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in early trade when the dollar rose near 110 yen," said\par a dealer from a local bank.\par     The greenback advanced broadly overnight after a mixed batch\par of U.S. economic data.\par     "I think the outflow is due mainly to big differentials\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 between Hong Kong and U.S. interest rates. The U.S. short-term   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rate is 1.25 percent, while the Hong Kong rate is 0.01-0.02   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 percent. The dollar/yen is an indirect factor," another trader at   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 a European bank.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Discounts on Hong Kong dollar forwards narrowed amid a fall\par in the aggregate balance soon.\par     The aggregate balance -- the sum of balances on clearing\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 accounts maintained by banks with the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary   \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  - will fall to HK$31.655 billion on Tuesday after the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 settlement of the HK$3.90 billion capital outflow.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The discount on one-year forwards          was trading around\par 670/650 pips, tightening from Thursday's close of 700/690 pips.\par     Hong Kong financial markets will be closed earlier on Friday\par as a typhoon signal number eight was hoisted, which roared toward\par the south China coast.\par                    Morning       Previous Close\par                    At 0356 GMT   At 0831 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT          7.7999/7.80   7.7998/99\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month       -237 / -232   -245 / -240\par  Six-month         -430 / -420   -445 / -435\par  One-year          -670 / -650   -700 / -690\par  INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight         0.02 / 0.05   0.005/ 0.01\par  Three-month       0.34 / 0.39   0.31 / 0.35\par  Six-month         0.75 / 0.80   0.71 / 0.75\par  One-year          1.41 / 1.46   1.34 / 1.39\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on\par Reuters contributor page .\par     (US$=HK$7.8).\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040716e07g000ht\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
