\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr weakens on strong US data, more outflows seen.   \b0\par\par\uc2 561 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Mai 2004\par 11:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, May 10 (Ron Monday, forcing the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to step in\par to defend the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  peg, as a strengthening U.S. dollar and\par a weak local stock market put pressure on the unit.\par     The Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2         fell back to its 7.80 pegged\par exchange rate to the U.S. dollar, down from 7.7995/96 in late\par Asian trade on Friday.\par     The Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (HKMA) is committed under\par the territory's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  regime to buy Hong Kong dollars to\par support the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if it weakens below 7.8 to the U.S.\par dollar. In late afternoon it bought HK$156 million from the\par market, selling U.S. dollars.\par     As a result, the HKMA forecasts the aggregate balance, the\par sum of balances on clearing accounts maintained :%Q!\par the HKMA, will fall to HK$54.383 billion from HK$54.541 billion\par on Monday after settlement of the HK$156 million outflow on\par Wednesday.\par     The U.S.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollar surged to an eight-month high against the\par yen        and neared recent 5-=   month highs against the euro\par   after much stronger-than-expected U.S. jobs data\par heightened market speculation the U.S. would raise interest\par rates sooner than expected.\par  \par     A stronger U.S. dollar makes U.S. dollar assets potentially\par more attractive.\par     A Reuters poll of 19 primary dealers on Wall Street found\par all expected a rise in the Fed funds rate by August and 11 saw\par a move as early as June.\par     Sharp losses in the Hong Kong stock market also sparked\par concerns about further capital outflows from the territory and\par put pressure on the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The blue-chip Hang Seng Index        shed 3.57 percent to\par its lowest close since September 30, its biggest daily drop\par this year.\par     The H-share index of China registered companies listed in\par Hong Kong  plunged 7.71 percent.\par     "I think there will be more outflows later (in New York or\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 London trade), as you can see the Hong Kong dollar (has stayed)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 at the peg rate after the HKMA's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said a dealer   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 from a European bank.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Discounts on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar forwards sharply narrowed on   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Monday, with the one-year contracts trading at 340/320   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 pips by late afternoon versus Friday's close of 455/445 pips.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In the cash market, longer-dated interbank rates were   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 firmer. The one-year interbank rate was quoted at 1.52 to 1.54   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 percent, rising from 1.23 to 1.25 percent on Friday.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                    At 0820 GMT   At 0305 GMT   At 0925 GMT\par  HK$ SPOT          7.7999/7.80   7.7998/99     7.7995/96\par  FORWARDS\par  Three-month       -158 / -153   -170 / -165  -175 / -172\par  Six-month         -250 / -240   -270 / -260  -295 / -285\par  One-year          -340 / -320   -390 / -370   -455 / -445\par  INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par  Overnight         0.001/0.003  0.0005/0.005  0.0008/0.001\par  Three-month       0.35 / 0.36   0.25 / 0.35   0.25 / 0.26\par  Six-month         0.78 / 0.80   0.68 / 0.78   0.62 / 0.63\par  One-year          1.52 / 1.54   1.43 / 1.48   1.23 / 1.25\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed\par on Reuters contributor page .\par     (US$=HK$7.8).\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040510e05a0014m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
