\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime.    \par \par \uc2 Some dealers expect the spot rate to trade in a range of    \par \par \uc2 7.7680-7.7730 in the near term. They also expect the Hong Kong    \par \par \uc2 dollar forwards to track movements in the spot market.     \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                   Late Morning  Previous Close\par                      At 0455 GMT   At 0854 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT        7.7707/08     7.7695/7.77\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -196 / -191   -195 / -190\par     Six-month        -376 / -366   -378 / -370\par     One-year         -660 / -650   -680 / -670\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight    0.00001/0.00003  0.00001/0.00003\par     Three-month      0.03 / 0.05   0.02 / 0.05\par     Six-month        0.11 / 0.14   0.11 / 0.14\par     One-year         0.43 / 0.45   0.34 / 0.46\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Reuters contributor page .    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040213e02d000ud\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
