\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong \highlight\uc2  dollar eases after HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .    \b0\par\par\uc2 501 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Februar 2004\par 04:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited    \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Feb 11 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar edged\par lower on Wednesday morning after the latest \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to stem the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rise against\par the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The territory's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in offshore markets\par overnight, selling HK$544 million and buying U.S. dollars. The\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will lift the aggregate balance -- a key measure of\par interbank liquidity -- to HK$54.725 billion on Thursday from\par Wednesday's HK$54.157 billion.\par  \par     The Hong Kong unit        was trading at 7.7700/02 at 0321\par GMT, weaker than 7.7686/87 in late Asian trade on Tuesday.\par     Meanwhile, Hong Kong dollar forwards were little moved. The\par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 discount on one-year forwards was quoted at 670/650    \f28 \par \par \uc2 pips, versus 660/640 pips earlier in the session and Tuesday's    \par \par \uc2 close of 675/665 pips.     \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are still strong. Foreign funds continue to\par flow into the regions," said a dealer at a European bank.\par     Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have been under pressure after last week's\par Group of Seven meeting.\par     G7 finance ministers said in a statement over the weekend\par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 that excess volatility and disorderly \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  movements were    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 undesirable and called for more \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  flexibility, a remark    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 seen primarily aimed at China.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Dealers said U.S. dollar weakness and renewed speculation    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 about a revaluation of the Chinese yuan would lend support to the    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong dollar.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 There is speculation the HKD will rise if the yuan is    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 revalued because of the increasing integration of Hong Kong's    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 economy with China's and despite its peg to the U.S. unit.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Chinese Premier Wen Jiabao pledged on Tuesday to keep the    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 yuan exchange rate stable and to "perfect" the exchange rate    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 system.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Wen's comments followed a denial by the Chinese authorities    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of a weekend newspaper report that a "substantial" step to    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 revalue the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  could come as early as next month.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Despite China reiterating that the country had no plans to    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 revalue its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , investors are still putting in funds here    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to prepare for any investment opportunities," another dealer    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 said.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan will deliver his    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 semi-annual monetary policy testimony to the House of    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Representatives on Wednesday and the Senate on Thursday. Players    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 will be watching for any pointers on when the next rise in U.S.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 interest rates is likely to come.     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                  Morning       Previous Close\par                      At 0321 GMT   At 0900 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7700/02     7.7687/89\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -195 / -190   -195 / -190\par     Six-month        -375 / -365   -375 / -370\par     One-year         -670 / -650   -675 / -655\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight    0.00005/0.00005 0.00005/0.00008\par     Three-month     0.04 / 0.05    0.02 / 0.04\par     Six-month       0.14 / 0.17    0.13 / 0.15\par     One-year        0.49 / 0.51    0.48 / 0.52\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters contributor page .    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040211e02b0018j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
