\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar steady despite HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 486 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 2004\par 11:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Jan 16 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar barely\par moved on Friday but the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par twice to stem the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rise.\par     "Funds will continue to flow in (to Hong Kong) as the\par economy is picking up," said a dealer from a European bank.\par     The unit        was trading at 7.7632/33 by 0916 GMT,\par compared with Thursday's close of 7.7634/35.\par     The Hong Kong dollar is pegged to the U.S. dollar at 7.80.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 However, it faced upward pressure since September on   \f28 \par \par \uc2 speculation China will widen its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band and on an   \par \par \uc2 improving local economy that has triggered a surge in fund   \par \par \uc2 flows to the territory, particularly from mainland China.   \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold HK$364 million in the   \par \par \uc2 afternoon in addition to HK$78 million it sold during New York   \par \par \uc2 trade earlier in the day, bringing total Hong Kong dollar sales   \par \par \uc2 to HK$442 million on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 Some dealers fear that demand for Hong Kong dollars could   \par \par \uc2 weaken as a recent wave of share placements in the stock market   \par \par \uc2 will encourage investors to take profits and repatriate funds.   \par \par \uc2 Hong Kong stocks ended lower on Friday as investors   \par \par \uc2 consolidated recent gains. The benchmark Hang Seng Index   \par \par \uc2 fell 82.05 points to 13,167.76, making a 1.63 percent loss on   \par \par \uc2 the week. The index gained 35 percent last year.   \par \par \uc2 But traders see no let up in HKMA \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as Chinese   \par \par \uc2 firms are planning to raise up to US$13 billion in initial   \par \par \uc2 public offerings on the Hong Kong bourse in 2004, well up the   \par \par \uc2 US$7.5 billion raised in all new share issues on the exchange   \par \par \uc2 in 2003.   \par \par \uc2 Hong Kong dollar forwards were rangebound.   \par \par \uc2 "There was some position adjustment in the market and I   \par \par \uc2 noted some big institutions bought one-year forwards," one   \par \par \uc2 trader said.   \par \par \uc2 The discount on one-year forwards was quoted at   \par \par \uc2 660/650 pips, unchanged from Thursday's close but narrower than   \par \par \uc2 Tuesday's low of 770 pips.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "The market looks to be consolidating after recent\par corrections," one dealer from a Japanese bank said.\par                      Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                      At 0900 GMT   At 0330 GMT   At 0850 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7632/34     7.7632/33     7.7634/35\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -196 / -192   -196 / -191   -197 / -191\par     Six-month        -370 / -365   -370 / -360   -370 / -360\par     One-year         -660 / -650   -665 / -645   -660 / -650\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight        0.001/0.001  0.0003/0.0003 0.0003/0.0005\par     Three-month      0.05 / 0.07   0.02 / 0.04   0.05 / 0.08\par     Six-month        0.12 / 0.14   0.10 / 0.12   0.12 / 0.16\par     One-year         0.41 / 0.43   0.38 / 0.40   0.35 / 0.40\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040116e01g001xv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
