\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar little moved after HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 586 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 2004\par 11:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Jan 12 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar barely\par moved on Monday as another round of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was offset by continued strong demand for the\par local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The HKMA, the territory's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , sold a total\par of HK$1.242 billion on Monday afternoon in two separate moves in\par a bid to curb the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's strength.\par     The latest \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will further boost the aggregate\par balance -- a key measure of interbank liquidity -- to a new high\par of HK$47.096 billion on Wednesday.\par     "I believe the inflow of funds was mainly for the stock and\par property markets. I don't see any speculative attacks in the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market," said one dealer at a local bank.\par  \par     The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2         traded at 7.7630/31 for most of the\par day, unchanged from Friday's close.\par     The Hong Kong dollar is pegged to the U.S. dollar at HK$7.80\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 per dollar, but the authority has \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  regularly in recent   \f28 \par \par \uc2 months to offset the strengthening impact of investment inflows   \par \par \uc2 into local stocks and initial public offerings.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The HKMA has \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at around 7.7630 recently and dealers\par see that as a support level for the U.S. dollar.\par     "The HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is aimed at stabilising the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par and maintaining the pace of economic recovery. If the local unit\par rises too fast, it will damage the economic recovery and affec    Hong Kong's economic recovery appears to be accelerating,\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 aided by a string of economic incentives from Beijing and a   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rebound in consumer confidence, fuelled in part by a surging   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 stock market.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong's leading shares ended little changed on Monday as   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 strong liquidity and firmer property shares offset a weak U.S.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 jobs report and worries that SARS was spreading in mainland   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong dollar forwards were rangebound but discounts   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 widened after the HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Earlier in the morning, the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 discount on longer-dated forwards narrowed as some players   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 covered their short positions on the back of a SARS scare.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China confirmed a possible third SARS case on Monday, a   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 35-year-old man isolated in hospital after showing symptoms of   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the respiratory disease.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     However, the discount on forwards widened in the afternoon\par after a further expansion in interbank liquidity.\par     The discount on one-year forwards          was quoted at\par 770/750 pips by late afternoon, compared with 730/710 on Friday.\par     In the cash market, longer-dated interbank rates eased\par following Friday's lower U.S. bond yields on weak U.S. jobs data\par as well as rising interbank liquidity.\par     One-year local rates softened to 0.30-0.33 percent from\par Friday's 0.40-0.45 percent.\par                      Close         Morning      Previous Close\par                      At 0930 GMT   At 0330 GMT  At 0850 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7630/31     7.7631/32    7.7630/31\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -201 / -196   -200 / -194  -200 / -195\par     Six-month        -397 / -387   -390 / -380  -385 / -375\par     One-year         -770 / -750   -745 / -725  -730 / -710\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight       0.0005/0.001550.0007/0.0007 0.001/0.001\par     Three-month      0.01 / 0.03   0.01 / 0.02  0.04 / 0.07\par     Six-month        0.07 / 0.10   0.09 / 0.10  0.12 / 0.14\par     One-year         0.30 / 0.33   0.30 / 0.33  0.40 / 0.45\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040112e01c002o4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
