\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar little changed after HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 586 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Januar 2004\par 11:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Jan 8 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar, buoyed by\par foreign funds pouring into the surging stock market, clung to a\par narrow range on Thursday despite repeated \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The HKMA, the territory's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , sold\par HK$2.554 billion in two separate moves on Thursday afternoon and\par bought U.S. dollars, according to information it publishes daily\par on Reuters screens .\par  \par     It has sold a total of HK$11.451 billion this week in a bid\par to curb the local unit's strength.\par     The moves lifted the aggregate balance -- a key measure of\par interbank liquidity -- to HK$43.898 billion next Monday.\par     The Hong Kong dollar        was trading at 7.7630/31 per U.S.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar for most of the day, though it hit 7.7633 in the early   \f28 \par \par \uc2 morning, dealers said. It was little changed compared with   \par \par \uc2 7.7632/33 late on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 "There is still strong selling of U.S. dollars and demand for   \par \par \uc2 Hong Kong dollars. That may be due to the overall bullish   \par \par \uc2 sentiment on Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and robust stock markets," said a   \par \par \uc2 dealer from a Japanese bank.   \par \par \uc2 "The economy is on the mend. Some funds are flowing in   \par \par \uc2 anticipation of the upcoming large IPOs. As a matter of fact,   \par \par \uc2 overseas funds have been coming into Hong Kong since the signing   \par \par \uc2 of CEPA," a dealer said.   \par \par \uc2 CEPA, a free trade deal signed between Hong Kong and mainland   \par \par \uc2 China in late June, gives Hong Kong companies easier access to   \par \par \uc2 the vast mainland market.   \par \par \uc2 The benchmark Hang Seng stock index ended up 0.35   \par \par \uc2 percent, or 46 points, at 13,203.59, a fresh two and a half year   \par \par \uc2 high.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Hong Kong dollar forwards were rangebound but the discounts\par widened slightly after the latest HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The discount on one-year forwards          were trading at\par 730/710 pips late on Thursday, versus 680 pips in early morning\par and Wednesday's close of 725/705 pips.\par     "I don't expect the forwards discount to widen too much from\par current levels as the budget deficit problem has not been\par resolved," the Japanese bank dealer said.\par     "Also, China has reported another suspected SARS case. If\par there are more cases to come that will weigh on the market," the\par dealer said.\par     The dealer expects the one-year forwards to move between -650\par and -750 pips in the near term.\par     A waitress in southern China was declared a suspected SARS\par case on Thursday.\par     In Hong Kong three members of a television crew were tested\par for the deadly virus after they developed fevers following a\par visit to China, raising fears of a new outbreak.\par     Two tested negative while results on a third were pending.\par                      Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                      At 0919 GMT   At 0330 GMT   At 0832 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7630/31     7.7630/31     7.7631/32\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -203 / -195   -200 / -195   -205 / -200\par     Six-month        -388 / -378   -380 / -370   -385 / -375\par     One-year         -730 / -710   -720 / -700   -725 / -705\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight        0.008/ 0.01   0.001/0.002   0.004/0.005\par     Three-month      0.05 / 0.06   0.04 / 0.06   0.05 / 0.07\par     Six-month        0.12 / 0.15   0.13 / 0.15   0.10 / 0.12\par     One-year         0.43 / 0.46   0.43 / 0.45   0.43 / 0.45\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040108e018001ml\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
