\par\par \b \uc2 HK dollar shrugs off flurry of HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 595 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 2004\par 04:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Jan 7 (Reuters) - A flurry of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  did little to budge the local dollar\par from its recent range on Wednesday morning as foreign investors\par continued to pour money into the surging stock market.\par  \par     "Hot money is still coming in," said a dealer from a French\par bank.\par     "I expect the Hong Kong dollar to stay on the high side,\par around the current levels, because the stock market is still\par strong," the dealer said.\par     The Hong Kong dollar        was trading at 7.7633/34 at 0314\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 GMT, compared with 7.7630/32 late on Tuesday. The benchmark Hang   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Seng share index, which has climbed for seven straight sessions,   \par \par \uc2 was up more than one percent.   \par \par \uc2 Foreign funds has been flowing into Hong Kong stock market,   \par \par \uc2 pushing market turnover to a near four-year high on Tuesday at   \par \par \uc2 HK$28.5 billion for the day.   \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong dollar is pegged to the U.S. unit at 7.80, but   \par \par \uc2 has been under upward pressure since September on speculation   \par \par \uc2 about a revaluation of the Chinese yuan, brighter domestic   \par \par \uc2 economic prospects and capital inflows.   \par \par \uc2 "I think there are some forces speculating about further   \par \par \uc2 strengthening in Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid the weakness in the U.S.   \par \par \uc2 dollar," said a dealer from a European bank.   \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is obligated to defend the   \par \par \uc2 HKD from weakening below its HK$7.80 peg with the U.S. dollar but   \par \par \uc2 has no mandate to stop it from strengthening above that level.   \par \par \uc2 "As the HKMA \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are transparent, people are   \par \par \uc2 testing the upper limit of the HK dollar. As the HKMA had   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at about 7.7630, people now think that it will   \par \par \uc2 invariably be buying U.S. dollars around that level," the dealer   \par \par \uc2 said.   \par \par \uc2 The HKMA \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times on Wednesday morning, selling   \par \par \uc2 HK$4.27 billion and buying U.S. dollars in an effort to stabilise   \par \par \uc2 the local unit. It sold HK$505 million on Monday and HK$4.06   \par \par \uc2 billion on Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 The latest \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will further boost the aggregate   \par \par \uc2 balance - a key measure of interbank liquidity - to a new high   \par \par \uc2 of HK$41.251 billion on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 However, the discount on Hong Kong dollar forwards deepened   \par \par \uc2 further and the interbank interest rates softened on rising   \par \par \uc2 interbank liquidity.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The discount on one-year forwards          widened to 750/730\par pips from Tuesday's 690/680 pips.\par     Meanwhile, the one-year interbank rates eased to 0.43-0.48\par percent, compared to 0.57-0.60 percent in the previous day.\par     Traders predict further HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the near term\par as a number of Chinese firms will seek listings in Hong Kong that\par will attract more overseas funds.\par     Hong Kong Chief Executive Tung Chee-hwa will deliver his\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 annual policy address on Wednesday afternoon. He is expected to   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 review the state of the territory's economic recovery and discuss   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 plans to tackle its large fiscal deficit.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                       Morning       Previous Close\par                      At 0314 GMT   At 0930 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7633/34       7.7630/32\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -207 / -202   -195 / -190\par     Six-month        -393 / -383   -380 / -370\par     One-year         -750 / -730   -690 / -680\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight        0.001/0.003   0.001/0.001\par     Three-month      0.04 / 0.07   0.08 / 0.10\par     Six-month        0.13 / 0.16   0.16 / 0.18\par     One-year         0.43 / 0.48   0.57 / 0.60\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040107e0170012x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
