\par\par \b \uc2 HK Dlr Mkts Late: Hibors Fall On Increased Liquidity  \b0\par\par\uc2 448 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 2004\par 09:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Hong Kong interbank offered rates eased Wednesday after fresh Hong Kong dollar sales by the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  boosted interbank liquidity.  \par \par \uc2 The quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold HK$4.27 billion Wednesday in its latest effort to weaken the local unit.  \par \par \uc2 The newest injections from the HKMA will likely boost the interbank surplus to more than HK$41 billion Friday when the transactions are settled. These large amounts of excess funds kept Hibors under downward pressure.  \par \par \uc2 The one-month Hibor was quoted at 0.03%, compared with 0.04% Tuesday. The 12-month Hibor was quoted at 0.50%, down from 0.62% previously.  \par \par \uc2 "It looks like this large amount of excess funds will stay in the market for quite sometime," one trader said.  \par \par \uc2 With excess liquidity possibly lasting months, banks are more willing to lend money for longer periods - six months and beyond.  \par \par \uc2 "There is almost no return anyway if banks lend for shorter maturity," the trader added.  \par \par \uc2 The discount on Hong Kong dollar forwards widened further, following the decline in Hibors.  \par \par \uc2 The one-year contract was quoted at 730-710 below the spot rate, compared with 685-675 Tuesday. It traded as low as 760 during the day.  \par \par \uc2 Despite another day of aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the HKMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar hardly budged.  \par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar was quoted at HK$7.7631, compared with HK$7.7628 Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 "If there are ongoing equity-driven inflows leading to solid demand for the Hong Kong dollar, further HKMA moves will still have little impact in weakening the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the trader said.  \par \par \uc2 Hong Kong Exchange Fund note yields fell in tandem with U.S. Treasury yields.  \par \par \uc2 The 10-year EF note was quoted at 4.27%, compared with 4.37% Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 Chief Executive Tung Chee-hwa's policy address Wednesday was generally ignored by market participants as his speech offered few policy initiatives on the economic front. Tung said the government would maintain its objectives of keeping business costs low and deepening ties with mainland China.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                   Latest        Late Tuesday \par Overnight Hibor   0.003%         0.003% \par 1-mo Hibor        0.03%          0.04% \par 3-mo Hibor        0.08%          0.09% \par 1-yr Hibor        0.50%          0.62% \par USD/HKD Spot      HK$7.7631      HK$7.7628 \par 6-mo HKD Fwd      -385 to -375   -380 to -370 \par 1-yr HKD Fwd      -730 to -710   -685 to -675 \par  \par 4.32% EF Note Due Dec. 2, 2013: \par  \par    Price: 100.83 Vs 99.98 \par    Yield: 4.27% Vs 4.37% \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Raymond Tsoi, Dow Jones Newswires; 852-2802-7002; raymond.tsoi@dowjones.com  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by John Viljoen  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1053 4178  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040107e017000a7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
