\par\par \b \uc2 HKMA/Sells HK$776 Mln HKD Fwds Discount Deepens  \b0\par\par\uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 2004\par 04:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \par [e-AGB00279a \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sold HK$776 million into the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market Tuesday morning in its latest move to cap the rise in the local unit.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  did little to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar. However, the injection of further liquidity into an already flush market drove the forwards discount to a deeper level.  \par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar was quoted at HK$7.7628 around 0330 GMT, compared with HK$7.7636 late Monday.  \par \par \uc2 The discount on the one-year Hong Kong dollar forward deepened further to 690-660, compared with 600-590 late Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "Forwards have been steadily falling so far. As there could be more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , excess liquidity is likely to persist, keeping forwards in a downtrend," a money trader with a local bank said.  \par \par \uc2 Since late September, the Hong Kong dollar has been trading at a rate stronger than its official peg to the U.S. dollar at HK$7.80, an unusual situation driven by a combination of flows of foreign investment into Hong Kong assets, and speculation on the possible appreciation of the yuan, using the Hong Kong dollar as a proxy.  \par \par \uc2 Hong Kong's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system automatically prevents the local unit from weakening away from the peg rate, but there is no such provision in the system to prevent it from strengthening - only the HKMA's discretion to sell the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in individual transactions.  \par \par \uc2 Since September, the HKMA has sold over HK$32 billion in its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Its efforts, however succeeded only in capping the rise of the local unit around HK$7.7600, and failed to push it back to the usual narrow range around the peg rate.  \par \par \uc2 The HKMA provides information on its market actions to financial data systems, but doesn't comment on them other than to say it acts as needed to counter market volatility.  \par \par \uc2 -By Raymond Tsoi, Dow Jones Newswires; 852-2802-7002; raymond.tsoi@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by John Viljoen  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040106e0160002r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
