\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-HK dollar remains strong despite HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 759 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Dezember 2003\par 10:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    (Add details on third HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Wednesday in paras\par 6-8, updates spot rate para 9)\par     HONG KONG, Dec 31 (Reuters) - The Hong Kong dollar remained\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2  stubbornly strong against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday,    \par \par \uc2  shrugging off repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary    \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) to weaken it as money for investment flows in.    \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the local unit to hold above its pegged    \par \par \uc2  exchange rate of 7.80 to the dollar for at least a couple of    \par \par \uc2  months.    \par \par \uc2  "I think some investors are shunning U.S.-denominated assets    \par \par \uc2  because the greenback is weak, but they need to find a way out    \par \par \uc2  for their ample funds," one trader at a local bank said.    \par \par \uc2  "Investors have fixed their eyes on the Hong Kong equities    \par \par \uc2  market and that's why liquidity keeps streaming into the city,"    \par \par \uc2  the trader said.    \par \par \uc2  The greenback slipped to a fresh record low against the euro    \par \par \uc2  on Wednesday and fell against the Japanese yen. The Hong Kong    \par \par \uc2  dollar rose along with other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .    \par \par \uc2  The HKMA, the territory's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  for the sixth time in two days on Wednesday afternoon in a bid to    \par \par \uc2  rein in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength.    \par \par \uc2  It sold a total of HK$2.531 billion and bought U.S. dollars    \par \par \uc2  in three separate moves on Wednesday in addition to selling    \par \par \uc2  HK$1.227 billion (US$158 million) on Tuesday.    \par \par \uc2  The latest move will further boost the aggregate balance - a    \par \par \uc2  key measure of interbank liquidity - to a new high of HK$32.035    \par \par \uc2  billion on Monday.    \par \par \uc2  After the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar exchange    \par \par \uc2  rate  was trading at 7.7631/32 at 0930 GMT, only marginally    \par \par \uc2  weaker than 7.7630/31 at mid-morning. It has appreciated by about    \par \par \uc2  0.46 percent compared with around 7.7988 last year.    \par \par \uc2  The local unit strengthened sharply in late September to    \par \par \uc2  7.705, driven by speculation about a revaluation of the Chinese    \par \par \uc2  yuan, brighter domestic economic prospects and capital inflows.    \par \par \uc2  It has slowly retreated to the 7.76-7.77 level after numerous    \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the HKMA, which has sold a cumulative HK$31.53    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The HKMA has \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at around 7.7630 recently and dealers\par saw that as a support level for the U.S. dollar.\par     Some dealers said strong gains in the Hong Kong stock market\par and a flurry of high profile initial public offerings have\par fuelled an inflow of funds and demand for the local dollar.\par     Hong Kong stocks ended modestly higher on the final trading\par day of 2003 on Wednesday, capping a solid 35 percent gain for the\par year that snapped a three-year losing streak.\par     Traders see a risk of further HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the near\par term as a number of Chinese firms will seek listings in Hong Kong\par next year that will attract more overseas investors.\par     Auditing firm PricewaterhouseCoopers predicted funds raised\par from Hong Kong IPOs could reach HK$100 billion (US$12.8 billion)\par next year.\par     "If the stock market continues to rise, the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is\par to remain comparatively strong," said a dealer at a Japanese\par bank.\par     Another dealer from a European bank expects the Hong Kong\par dollar to remain strong for at least three to six months.\par     Hong Kong interbank interest rates fell in the face of\par capital inflows and the rises in interbank liquidity. Short-term\par rates traded near zero.\par     The discount on the one-year Hong Kong dollar forwards\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  , reflecting the market perceptions of the unit's\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par appreciation over the next year, widened to a new low 610/590\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par pips from Tuesday's close of 575/555 pips.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A pip represents 1/10,000th of a Hong Kong dollar.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Hong Kong financial markets will be closed on Thursday for\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                      Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                      At 0850 GMT   At 0345 GMT   At 0900 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7630/33     7.7630/31     7.7631/32\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -195 / -190   -192 / -185   -188 / -183\par     Six-month        -375 / -355   -365 / -355   -360 / -350\par     One-year         -610 / -590   -590 / -570   -575 / -555\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight        0.005/0.008 0.0005 / 0.001 0.002 / 0.005\par     Three-month      0.06 / 0.08   0.07 / 0.08   0.09 / 0.10\par     Six-month        0.17 / 0.19   0.18 / 0.20   0.20 / 0.21\par     One-year         0.58 / 0.60   0.60 / 0.63   0.61 / 0.63\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Reuters contributor page .\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031231dzcv0030z\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (hong kong near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbr